# Valid images must decode with stable checksums.
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile input 1 file img/good4.png
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 2 nofile input 1 file img/good4.gif
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
show 1+1
